{"parentUuid":null,"isSidechain":true,"promptId":"ac68b9dc-9847-4e6f-8ec2-6b4367414408","agentId":"a660692b75d21afb7","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"调研 Optuna vs SMAC3 vs Hyperopt vs BoTorch vs Random vs Grid 在求解器超参调优上的实证对比。\n\n**背景：** Round 5 调研 cpsat-autotune（基于 Optuna）。但 SMAC3 是 ML-based optimizer 圈里跟 Optuna 并列的，BoTorch 用 GP-BO。看哪个对我们 CP-SAT 调参最优。\n\n**调研重点（≤800 字）：**\n1. Optuna 2024-2026 进展（TPE / CMA-ES backends）\n2. SMAC3 (AutoML) 现状\n3. Hyperopt 是否还活着\n4. BoTorch / Ax (Meta)\n5. Nevergrad\n6. 在 SAT solver 调参 benchmark 上的对比\n7. 我们 168h budget 适合哪个\n8. 多目标（time + memory）支持\n\n输出末尾：\"换 Optuna 之外的工具值得吗\""},"uuid":"50c3ecd7-f35b-4498-bf0f-18f45ceb3009","timestamp":"2026-05-07T22:10:37.863Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd\\.upstream_clones","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
